      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rockwell_City%2C_Iowa",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The museum’s roots trace back to 1902, preserving artifacts that chronicle Calhoun County’s past.",
